@16001 = ~Ugloril, the Medusa Queen~
@16002 = ~Servant of Ugloril~
@16003 = ~These boxes each contain bones and a skull. Sometimes there is no skull, sometimes there are very few bones.~
@16004 = ~The hooks on this device have been used recently—they are still bloody.~
@16005 = ~These barrels contain a paste used to embalm corpses.~
@16006 = ~A metal totem whose function remains a mystery.~
@16007 = ~These barrels contain dried entrails.~
@16008 = ~These barrels contain dried hearts. Strangely, some are still beating.~
@16009 = ~Orc-made siege equipment.~
@16010 = ~A large cannon. A relic from a forgotten war.~
@16011 = ~This table and chairs seem recent. They may be used by vampires; they are the most “alive” things in the area.~
@16012 = ~Old siege equipment~
@16013 = ~A small cannon. Relic of a forgotten war~
@16014 = ~Key to access the boss~
@16015 = ~This is the key needed to access the throne of this challenge's boss.~
@16017 = ~Zombie ju-ju~
